cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "hpdesignbench: A benchmarking framework for discrete structural optimisation of CFRP-prestressed HP shell slabs"
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dombrowski
    given-names: Max
    email: m.dombrowski@tu-berlin.de
    affiliation: Technische Universität Berlin
  - family-names: Melcer
    given-names: Elliot
    affiliation: Technische Universität Berlin
abstract: >-
  hpdesignbench is a benchmarking framework for discrete structural
  optimisation of CFRP-prestressed HP shell slabs. Data created with
  hpdesignbench is not part of this repository. The configs under
  configs/release/ can be used to reproduce the optimisation runs and
  landscape analyses from the research articles associated with
  hpdesignbench.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kildd/hpdesignbench"
